Cell[TextData[{
 "In many cases, these critical points can be interpreted as the number of \
master integrals in ",
 "a given sector. However, this number is known to sometimes undercount. When \
combined with the ",
 "possibility of magic relations, a naive interpretation of this result must \
be taken with caution. ",
 "An explicit example of such an undercount is given in the Possible Issues \
section of the ",
 "reference page of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CountSectorsUnregulated"]], 
    "paclet:DiscKosky/ref/CountSectorsUnregulated", 
    "DiscKosky Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "208bf9c9-8fc7-4050-bbc8-70b09f45e50a"],
 "."
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->2127193535,ExpressionUUID->"69f1cf03-b1e6-427a-b016-38deeaa18753"]
}, Open  ]],

