  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "b3557e1b-f2b7-4e4f-9951-503df476d484"],
 " also supports the computation of critical points on the ",
 "support of kinematic constraints, via the ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Constraint\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "0476e8f5-ffa9-4f19-afce-9e82f105529d"],
